 468:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Affects both group regular and group injected (availability
 469:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         of ADC group injected depends on STM32 series).
 470:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to corresponding unitary functions into
 471:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @ref ADC_LL_EF_Configuration_ADC_Instance .
