2963:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (1) On STM32G4, parameter available only on ADC instance: ADC1.\n
2964:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (2) On STM32G4, parameter available only on ADC instance: ADC2.\n
