2970:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             On this STM32 series, all ADCx are not available on all devices. Refer to device da
2971:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             more details.
2972:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (8) On STM32G4, fast channel allows: 2.5 (sampling) + 12.5 (conversion) = 15 ADC clock 
2973:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             convert in 12-bit resolution.
2974:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Other channels are slow channels  allows: 6.5 (sampling) + 12.5 (conversion) = 19 A
2975:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (fADC) to convert in 12-bit resolution.\n
2976:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (1, 2, 3, 4, 5, 7) For ADC channel read back from ADC register,
