3405:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, calibration data of internal voltage reference
3406:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         VrefInt corresponds to a resolution of 12 bits,
3407:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         this is the recommended ADC resolution to convert voltage of
3408:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         internal voltage reference VrefInt.
