3492:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
3493:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Helper macro to calculate the temperature (unit: degree Celsius)
3494:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         from ADC conversion data of internal temperature sensor.
3495:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Computation is using temperature sensor typical values
3496:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (refer to device datasheet).
3497:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Calculation formula:
3498:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Temperature = (TS_TYP_CALx_VOLT(uV) - TS_ADC_DATA * Conversion_uV)
3499:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                         / Avg_Slope + CALx_TEMP
3500:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           with TS_ADC_DATA      = temperature sensor raw data measured by ADC
3501:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                   (unit: digital value)
3502:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                Avg_Slope        = temperature sensor slope
3503:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                   (unit: uV/Degree Celsius)
3504:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                TS_TYP_CALx_VOLT = temperature sensor digital value at
3505:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *                                   temperature CALx_TEMP (unit: mV)
3506:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Caution: Calculation relevancy under reserve the temperature sensor
