4077:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC selected offset instance 1, 2, 3 or 4.
4078:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   This function set the 2 items of offset configuration:
4079:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - ADC channel to which the offset programmed will be applied
4080:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           (independently of channel mapped on ADC group regular
4081:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           or group injected)
4082:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Offset level (offset to be subtracted from the raw
4083:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           converted data).
4084:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Caution: Offset format is dependent to ADC resolution:
4085:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         offset has to be left-aligned on bit 11, the LSB (right bits)
4086:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         are set to 0.
4087:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   This function enables the offset, by default. It can be forced
4088:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         to disable state using function LL_ADC_SetOffsetState().
4089:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   If a channel is mapped on several offsets numbers, only the offset
4090:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         with the lowest value is considered for the subtraction.
4091:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
4092:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
4093:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC must be disabled or enabled without conversion on going
