4611:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   To determine whether group regular trigger source is
4612:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         internal (SW start) or external, without detail
4613:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         of which peripheral is selected as external trigger,
