4617:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Availability of parameters of trigger sources from timer
4618:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         depends on timers availability on the selected device.
4619:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll CFGR     EXTSEL         LL_ADC_REG_GetTriggerSource\n
4620:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         CFGR     EXTEN          LL_ADC_REG_GetTriggerSource
