4833:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
4834:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get ADC group regular sequencer length and scan direction.
4835:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Description of ADC group regular sequencer features:
4836:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - For devices with sequencer fully configurable
4837:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           (function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks()" available):
4838:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           sequencer length and each rank affectation to a channel
4839:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           are configurable.
4840:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           This function retrieves:
4841:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence length: Number of ranks in the scan sequence.
4842:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence direction: Unless specified in parameters, sequencer
4843:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             scan direction is forward (from rank 1 to rank n).
4844:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Sequencer ranks are selected using
4845:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerRanks()".
4846:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - For devices with sequencer not fully configurable
4847:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           (function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerChannels()" available):
4848:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           sequencer length and each rank affectation to a channel
4849:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           are defined by channel number.
4850:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           This function retrieves:
4851:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence length: Number of ranks in the scan sequence is
4852:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             defined by number of channels set in the sequence,
4853:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             rank of each channel is fixed by channel HW number.
4854:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (channel 0 fixed on rank 0, channel 1 fixed on rank1, ...).
4855:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - Sequence direction: Unless specified in parameters, sequencer
4856:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             scan direction is forward (from lowest channel number to
4857:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             highest channel number).
4858:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           Sequencer ranks are selected using
4859:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           function "LL_ADC_REG_SetSequencerChannels()".
4860:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Sequencer disabled is equivalent to sequencer of 1 rank:
4861:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC conversion on only 1 channel.
