5068:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - To reinject this channel into another function LL_ADC_xxx:
5069:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           the returned channel number is only partly formatted on definition
5070:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           of literals LL_ADC_CHANNEL_x. Therefore, it has to be compared
