5172:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
5173:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC continuous conversion mode on ADC group regular.
5174:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Description of ADC continuous conversion mode:
5175:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - single mode: one conversion per trigger
5176:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - continuous mode: after the first trigger, following
