6557:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /** @defgroup ADC_LL_EF_Configuration_ADC_AnalogWatchdog Configuration of ADC transversal scope: an
6558:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @{
6559:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   */
6560:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** 
6561:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
6562:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC analog watchdog monitored channels:
6563:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         a single channel, multiple channels or all channels,
6564:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on ADC groups regular and-or injected.
6565:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   Once monitored channels are selected, analog watchdog
6566:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         is enabled.
6567:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   In case of need to define a single channel to monitor
6568:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         with analog watchdog from sequencer channel definition,
6569:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         use helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_ANALOGWD_CHANNEL_GROUP().
6570:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, there are 2 kinds of analog watchdog
6571:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         instance:
6572:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD standard (instance AWD1):
6573:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: can monitor 1 channel or all channels.
6574:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: ADC groups regular and-or injected.
6575:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is not limited (corresponds to
6576:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             ADC resolution configured).
6577:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD flexible (instances AWD2, AWD3):
6578:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: flexible on channels monitored, selection is
6579:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             channel wise, from from 1 to all channels.
6580:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Specificity of this analog watchdog: Multiple channels can
6581:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             be selected. For example:
6582:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL4_REG_INJ | LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL5_REG_INJ | ...)
6583:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: not selection possible (monitoring on both
6584:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             groups regular and injected).
6585:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Channels selected are monitored on groups regular and injected:
6586:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG_INJ (do not use parameters
6587:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG and LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_INJ)
6588:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is limited to 8 bits: if ADC resolution is
6589:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             12 bits the 4 LSB are ignored, if ADC resolution is 10 bits
6590:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             the 2 LSB are ignored.
6591:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
6592:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
6593:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC must be disabled or enabled without conversion on going
6594:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on either groups regular or injected.
6595:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll CFGR     AWD1CH         LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDMonitChannels\n
6596:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         CFGR     AWD1SGL        LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDMonitChannels\n
6597:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         CFGR     AWD1EN         LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDMonitChannels\n
6598:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         CFGR     JAWD1EN        LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDMonitChannels\n
6599:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         AWD2CR   AWD2CH         LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDMonitChannels\n
6600:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         AWD3CR   AWD3CH         LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDMonitChannels
6601:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
