  27:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                      ##### ADC peripheral features #####
  28:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  29:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   [..]
  30:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) 12-bit, 10-bit, 8-bit or 6-bit configurable resolution.
  31:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  32:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) Interrupt generation at the end of regular conversion and in case of
  33:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****       analog watchdog or overrun events.
  34:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  35:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) Single and continuous conversion modes.
  36:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  37:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) Scan mode for conversion of several channels sequentially.
  38:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  39:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) Data alignment with in-built data coherency.
  40:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  41:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) Programmable sampling time (channel wise)
  42:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  43:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) External trigger (timer or EXTI) with configurable polarity
  44:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  45:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) DMA request generation for transfer of conversions data of regular group.
  46:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  47:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) Configurable delay between conversions in Dual interleaved mode.
  48:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  49:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) ADC channels selectable single/differential input.
  50:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  51:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) ADC offset shared on 4 offset instances.
  52:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) ADC gain compensation
  53:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  54:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) ADC calibration
  55:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  56:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) ADC conversion of regular group.
  57:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  58:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   (+) ADC supply requirements: 1.62 V to 3.6 V.
