  64:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                      ##### How to use this driver #####
  65:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   ==============================================================================
  66:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
  67:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  68:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      *** Configuration of top level parameters related to ADC ***
  69:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      ============================================================
  70:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
  71:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  72:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Enable the ADC interface
  73:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) As prerequisite, ADC clock must be configured at RCC top level.
  74:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  75:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) Two clock settings are mandatory:
  76:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) ADC clock (core clock, also possibly conversion clock).
  77:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  78:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) ADC clock (conversions clock).
  79:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    Two possible clock sources: synchronous clock derived from AHB clock
  80:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    or asynchronous clock derived from system clock or PLL (output divider P)
  81:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    running up to 75MHz.
  82:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  83:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****              (+++) Example:
  84:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    Into HAL_ADC_MspInit() (recommended code location) or with
  85:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                    other device clock parameters configuration:
  86:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) __HAL_RCC_ADC_CLK_ENABLE();                  (mandatory)
  87:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  88:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                RCC_ADCCLKSOURCE_PLL enable:                       (optional: if asynchronous clock 
  89:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) RCC_PeriphClkInitTypeDef   RCC_PeriphClkInit;
  90:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) PeriphClkInit.PeriphClockSelection = RCC_PERIPHCLK_ADC;
  91:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) PeriphClkInit.AdcClockSelection    = RCC_ADCCLKSOURCE_PLL;
  92:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                (+++) HAL_RCCEx_PeriphCLKConfig(&PeriphClkInit);
  93:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  94:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) ADC clock source and clock prescaler are configured at ADC level with
  95:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****              parameter "ClockPrescaler" using function HAL_ADC_Init().
  96:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
  97:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) ADC pins configuration
  98:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Enable the clock for the ADC GPIOs
  99:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****               using macro __HAL_RCC_GPIOx_CLK_ENABLE()
 100:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Configure these ADC pins in analog mode
 101:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****               using function HAL_GPIO_Init()
 102:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 103:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Optionally, in case of usage of ADC with interruptions:
 104:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Configure the NVIC for ADC
 105:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****               using function HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ(ADCx_IRQn)
 106:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Insert the ADC interruption handler function HAL_ADC_IRQHandler()
 107:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****               into the function of corresponding ADC interruption vector
 108:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****               ADCx_IRQHandler().
 109:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 110:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Optionally, in case of usage of DMA:
 111:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Configure the DMA (DMA channel, mode normal or circular, ...)
 112:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****               using function HAL_DMA_Init().
 113:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Configure the NVIC for DMA
 114:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****               using function HAL_NVIC_EnableIRQ(DMAx_Channelx_IRQn)
 115:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****          (++) Insert the ADC interruption handler function HAL_ADC_IRQHandler()
 116:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****               into the function of corresponding DMA interruption vector
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccWACfIr.s 			page 124


 117:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****               DMAx_Channelx_IRQHandler().
