 119:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      *** Configuration of ADC, group regular, channels parameters ***
 120:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      ================================================================
 121:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 122:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 123:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Configure the ADC parameters (resolution, data alignment, ...)
 124:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         and regular group parameters (conversion trigger, sequencer, ...)
 125:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         using function HAL_ADC_Init().
 126:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 127:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Configure the channels for regular group parameters (channel number,
 128:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         channel rank into sequencer, ..., into regular group)
 129:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         using function HAL_ADC_ConfigChannel().
 130:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 131:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Optionally, configure the analog watchdog parameters (channels
 132:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         monitored, thresholds, ...)
 133:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         using function HAL_ADC_AnalogWDGConfig().
 134:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 135:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      *** Execution of ADC conversions ***
 136:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      ====================================
 137:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 138:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 139:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) Optionally, perform an automatic ADC calibration to improve the
 140:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         conversion accuracy
 141:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         using function HAL_ADCEx_Calibration_Start().
 142:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 143:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     (#) ADC driver can be used among three modes: polling, interruption,
 144:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         transfer by DMA.
 145:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 146:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) ADC conversion by polling:
 147:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****           (+++) Activate the ADC peripheral and start conversions
 148:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                 using function HAL_ADC_Start()
 149:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****           (+++) Wait for ADC conversion completion
 150:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                 using function HAL_ADC_PollForConversion()
 151:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****           (+++) Retrieve conversion results
 152:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                 using function HAL_ADC_GetValue()
 153:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****           (+++) Stop conversion and disable the ADC peripheral
 154:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                 using function HAL_ADC_Stop()
 155:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 156:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****         (++) ADC conversion by interruption:
 157:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****           (+++) Activate the ADC peripheral and start conversions
 158:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                 using function HAL_ADC_Start_IT()
 159:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****           (+++) Wait for ADC conversion completion by call of function
 160:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                 HAL_ADC_ConvCpltCallback()
 161:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****                 (this function must be implemented in user program)
 162:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****           (+++) Retrieve conversion results
