 219:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     *** Callback registration ***
 220:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     =============================================
 221:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 222:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 223:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      The compilation flag USE_HAL_ADC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS, when set to 1,
 224:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      allows the user to configure dynamically the driver callbacks.
 225:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Use Functions @ref HAL_ADC_RegisterCallback()
 226:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      to register an interrupt callback.
 227:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 228:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 229:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Function @ref HAL_ADC_RegisterCallback() allows to register following callbacks:
 230:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvCpltCallback               : ADC conversion complete callback
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccWACfIr.s 			page 126


 231:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvHalfCpltCallback           : ADC conversion DMA half-transfer callback
 232:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindowCallback       : ADC analog watchdog 1 callback
 233:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback                  : ADC error callback
 234:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedConvCpltCallback       : ADC group injected conversion complete callback
 235:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedQueueOverflowCallback  : ADC group injected context queue overflow callback
 236:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow2Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 2 callback
 237:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow3Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 3 callback
 238:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) EndOfSamplingCallback          : ADC end of sampling callback
 239:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback                : ADC Msp Init callback
 240:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback              : ADC Msp DeInit callback
 241:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      This function takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle, the Callback ID
 242:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      and a pointer to the user callback function.
 243:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 244:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 245:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Use function @ref HAL_ADC_UnRegisterCallback to reset a callback to the default
 246:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      weak function.
 247:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 248:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 249:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      @ref HAL_ADC_UnRegisterCallback takes as parameters the HAL peripheral handle,
 250:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      and the Callback ID.
 251:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      This function allows to reset following callbacks:
 252:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvCpltCallback               : ADC conversion complete callback
 253:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ConvHalfCpltCallback           : ADC conversion DMA half-transfer callback
 254:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindowCallback       : ADC analog watchdog 1 callback
 255:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) ErrorCallback                  : ADC error callback
 256:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedConvCpltCallback       : ADC group injected conversion complete callback
 257:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) InjectedQueueOverflowCallback  : ADC group injected context queue overflow callback
 258:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow2Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 2 callback
 259:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) LevelOutOfWindow3Callback      : ADC analog watchdog 3 callback
 260:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) EndOfSamplingCallback          : ADC end of sampling callback
 261:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspInitCallback                : ADC Msp Init callback
 262:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****        (+) MspDeInitCallback              : ADC Msp DeInit callback
 263:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 264:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 265:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      By default, after the @ref HAL_ADC_Init() and when the state is @ref HAL_ADC_STATE_RESET
 266:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      all callbacks are set to the corresponding weak functions:
 267:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      examples @ref HAL_ADC_ConvCpltCallback(), @ref HAL_ADC_ErrorCallback().
 268:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Exception done for MspInit and MspDeInit functions that are
 269:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      reset to the legacy weak functions in the @ref HAL_ADC_Init()/ @ref HAL_ADC_DeInit() only when
 270:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      these callbacks are null (not registered beforehand).
 271:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 272:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 273:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      If MspInit or MspDeInit are not null, the @ref HAL_ADC_Init()/ @ref HAL_ADC_DeInit()
 274:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      keep and use the user MspInit/MspDeInit callbacks (registered beforehand) whatever the state.
 275:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 276:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 277:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Callbacks can be registered/unregistered in @ref HAL_ADC_STATE_READY state only.
 278:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Exception done MspInit/MspDeInit functions that can be registered/unregistered
 279:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      in @ref HAL_ADC_STATE_READY or @ref HAL_ADC_STATE_RESET state,
 280:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      thus registered (user) MspInit/DeInit callbacks can be used during the Init/DeInit.
 281:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****     [..]
 282:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 283:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      Then, the user first registers the MspInit/MspDeInit user callbacks
 284:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      using @ref HAL_ADC_RegisterCallback() before calling @ref HAL_ADC_DeInit()
 285:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      or @ref HAL_ADC_Init() function.
 286:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      [..]
 287:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccWACfIr.s 			page 127


 288:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      When the compilation flag USE_HAL_ADC_REGISTER_CALLBACKS is set to 0 or
 289:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      not defined, the callback registration feature is not available and all callbacks
 290:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****      are set to the corresponding weak functions.
 291:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** 
 292:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   @endverbatim
