 368:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** /**
 369:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @brief  Initialize the ADC peripheral and regular group according to
 370:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         parameters specified in structure "ADC_InitTypeDef".
 371:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   As prerequisite, ADC clock must be configured at RCC top level
 372:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         (refer to description of RCC configuration for ADC
 373:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         in header of this file).
 374:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   Possibility to update parameters on the fly:
 375:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         This function initializes the ADC MSP (HAL_ADC_MspInit()) only when
 376:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         coming from ADC state reset. Following calls to this function can
 377:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         be used to reconfigure some parameters of ADC_InitTypeDef
 378:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         structure on the fly, without modifying MSP configuration. If ADC
 379:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         MSP has to be modified again, HAL_ADC_DeInit() must be called
 380:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         before HAL_ADC_Init().
 381:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         The setting of these parameters is conditioned to ADC state.
 382:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         For parameters constraints, see comments of structure
 383:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         "ADC_InitTypeDef".
 384:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   This function configures the ADC within 2 scopes: scope of entire
 385:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         ADC and scope of regular group. For parameters details, see comments
 386:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         of structure "ADC_InitTypeDef".
 387:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @note   Parameters related to common ADC registers (ADC clock mode) are set
 388:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         only if all ADCs are disabled.
 389:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         If this is not the case, these common parameters setting are
 390:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         bypassed without error reporting: it can be the intended behaviour in
 391:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         case of update of a parameter of ADC_InitTypeDef on the fly,
 392:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         without  disabling the other ADCs.
