 695:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c **** /**
 696:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   * @brief  Deinitialize the ADC peripheral registers to their default reset
 697:platform/HAL/src/stm32g4xx_hal_adc.c ****   *         values, with deinitialization of the ADC MSP.
