6910:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
6911:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC analog watchdog thresholds value of both thresholds
6912:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         high and low.
6913:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   If value of only one threshold high or low must be set,
6914:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         use function @ref LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds().
6915:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   In case of ADC resolution different of 12 bits,
6916:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         analog watchdog thresholds data require a specific shift.
6917:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Use helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_ANALOGWD_SET_THRESHOLD_RESOLUTION().
6918:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, there are 2 kinds of analog watchdog
6919:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         instance:
6920:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD standard (instance AWD1):
6921:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: can monitor 1 channel or all channels.
6922:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: ADC groups regular and-or injected.
6923:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is not limited (corresponds to
6924:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             ADC resolution configured).
6925:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD flexible (instances AWD2, AWD3):
6926:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: flexible on channels monitored, selection is
6927:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             channel wise, from from 1 to all channels.
6928:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Specificity of this analog watchdog: Multiple channels can
6929:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             be selected. For example:
6930:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL4_REG_INJ | LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL5_REG_INJ | ...)
6931:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: not selection possible (monitoring on both
6932:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             groups regular and injected).
6933:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Channels selected are monitored on groups regular and injected:
6934:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG_INJ (do not use parameters
6935:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG and LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_INJ)
6936:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is limited to 8 bits: if ADC resolution is
6937:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             12 bits the 4 LSB are ignored, if ADC resolution is 10 bits
6938:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             the 2 LSB are ignored.
6939:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   If ADC oversampling is enabled, ADC analog watchdog thresholds are
6940:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         impacted: the comparison of analog watchdog thresholds is done on
6941:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         oversampling final computation (after ratio and shift application):
6942:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC data register bitfield [15:4] (12 most significant bits).
6943:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Examples:
6944:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Oversampling ratio and shift selected to have ADC conversion data
6945:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           on 12 bits (ratio 16 and shift 4, or ratio 32 and shift 5, ...):
6946:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           ADC analog watchdog thresholds must be divided by 16.
6947:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Oversampling ratio and shift selected to have ADC conversion data
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccWACfIr.s 			page 144


6948:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           on 14 bits (ratio 16 and shift 2, or ratio 32 and shift 3, ...):
6949:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           ADC analog watchdog thresholds must be divided by 4.
6950:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Oversampling ratio and shift selected to have ADC conversion data
6951:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           on 16 bits (ratio 16 and shift none, or ratio 32 and shift 1, ...):
6952:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           ADC analog watchdog thresholds match directly to ADC data register.
6953:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll TR1      HT1            LL_ADC_ConfigAnalogWDThresholds\n
6954:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR2      HT2            LL_ADC_ConfigAnalogWDThresholds\n
6955:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR3      HT3            LL_ADC_ConfigAnalogWDThresholds\n
6956:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR1      LT1            LL_ADC_ConfigAnalogWDThresholds\n
6957:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR2      LT2            LL_ADC_ConfigAnalogWDThresholds\n
6958:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR3      LT3            LL_ADC_ConfigAnalogWDThresholds
6959:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
6960:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  AWDy This parameter can be one of the following values:
6961:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD1
6962:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD2
6963:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD3
6964:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  AWDThresholdHighValue Value between Min_Data=0x000 and Max_Data=0xFFF
6965:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  AWDThresholdLowValue Value between Min_Data=0x000 and Max_Data=0xFFF
6966:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @retval None
