6984:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h **** /**
6985:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Set ADC analog watchdog threshold value of threshold
6986:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         high or low.
6987:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   If values of both thresholds high or low must be set,
6988:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         use function @ref LL_ADC_ConfigAnalogWDThresholds().
6989:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   In case of ADC resolution different of 12 bits,
6990:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         analog watchdog thresholds data require a specific shift.
6991:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Use helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_ANALOGWD_SET_THRESHOLD_RESOLUTION().
6992:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, there are 2 kinds of analog watchdog
6993:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         instance:
6994:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD standard (instance AWD1):
6995:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: can monitor 1 channel or all channels.
6996:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: ADC groups regular and-or injected.
6997:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is not limited (corresponds to
6998:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             ADC resolution configured).
6999:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - AWD flexible (instances AWD2, AWD3):
7000:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - channels monitored: flexible on channels monitored, selection is
7001:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             channel wise, from from 1 to all channels.
7002:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Specificity of this analog watchdog: Multiple channels can
7003:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             be selected. For example:
7004:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             (LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL4_REG_INJ | LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNEL5_REG_INJ | ...)
ARM GAS  /tmp/ccWACfIr.s 			page 145


7005:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - groups monitored: not selection possible (monitoring on both
7006:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             groups regular and injected).
7007:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             Channels selected are monitored on groups regular and injected:
7008:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG_INJ (do not use parameters
7009:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_REG and LL_ADC_AWD_CHANNELxx_INJ)
7010:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           - resolution: resolution is limited to 8 bits: if ADC resolution is
7011:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             12 bits the 4 LSB are ignored, if ADC resolution is 10 bits
7012:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *             the 2 LSB are ignored.
7013:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   If ADC oversampling is enabled, ADC analog watchdog thresholds are
7014:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         impacted: the comparison of analog watchdog thresholds is done on
7015:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         oversampling final computation (after ratio and shift application):
7016:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC data register bitfield [15:4] (12 most significant bits).
7017:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Examples:
7018:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Oversampling ratio and shift selected to have ADC conversion data
7019:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           on 12 bits (ratio 16 and shift 4, or ratio 32 and shift 5, ...):
7020:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           ADC analog watchdog thresholds must be divided by 16.
7021:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Oversampling ratio and shift selected to have ADC conversion data
7022:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           on 14 bits (ratio 16 and shift 2, or ratio 32 and shift 3, ...):
7023:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           ADC analog watchdog thresholds must be divided by 4.
7024:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         - Oversampling ratio and shift selected to have ADC conversion data
7025:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           on 16 bits (ratio 16 and shift none, or ratio 32 and shift 1, ...):
7026:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *           ADC analog watchdog thresholds match directly to ADC data register.
7027:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is not conditioned to
7028:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
7029:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC can be disabled, enabled with or without conversion on going
7030:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         on either ADC groups regular or injected.
7031:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll TR1      HT1            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
7032:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR2      HT2            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
7033:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR3      HT3            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
7034:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR1      LT1            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
7035:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR2      LT2            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds\n
7036:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         TR3      LT3            LL_ADC_SetAnalogWDThresholds
7037:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
7038:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  AWDy This parameter can be one of the following values:
7039:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD1
7040:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD2
7041:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         @arg @ref LL_ADC_AWD3
