7366:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         This check can be done with function @ref LL_ADC_IsEnabled() for each
7367:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC instance or by using helper macro
