7371:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (can be set directly from CMSIS definition or by using helper macro @ref __LL_ADC_COMMO
7372:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  Multimode This parameter can be one of the following values:
