7588:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         state, the internal analog calibration is lost. After exiting from
7589:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         deep power down, calibration must be relaunched or calibration factor
7590:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (preliminarily saved) must be set back into calibration register.
7591:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, setting of this feature is conditioned to
7592:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC state:
