ARM GAS  /tmp/ccWACfIr.s 			page 160


7692:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC internal analog stabilization is required before performing a
7693:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         ADC conversion start.
7694:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         Refer to device datasheet, parameter tSTAB.
7695:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, flag LL_ADC_FLAG_ADRDY is raised when the ADC
7696:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         is enabled and when conversion clock is active.
