8256:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @brief  Get flag ADC ready.
8257:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @note   On this STM32 series, flag LL_ADC_FLAG_ADRDY is raised when the ADC
8258:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         is enabled and when conversion clock is active.
8259:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   *         (not only core clock: this ADC has a dual clock domain)
8260:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @rmtoll ISR      ADRDY          LL_ADC_IsActiveFlag_ADRDY
8261:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @param  ADCx ADC instance
8262:platform/HAL/inc/stm32g4xx_ll_adc.h ****   * @retval State of bit (1 or 0).
